cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PriDB-Health in research, please cite this software."
title: "PriDB-Health: A Three-Layer Privacy-by-Design Research Prototype for Hospital Databases"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Sudipta"
    alias: "the-sudipta"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-16
repository-code: "https://github.com/the-sudipta/pridb-health"
url: "https://the-sudipta.github.io/pridb-health/"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - health data privacy
  - PostgreSQL
  - row-level security
  - k-anonymity
  - l-diversity
  - t-closeness
  - differential privacy
  - privacy by design
abstract: >-
  PriDB-Health is a reproducible research prototype that integrates PostgreSQL
  role-based and row-level access controls, anonymized research releases, and
  differentially private aggregate queries. Eight configurations are compared
  through an explicit experimental Privacy Risk Score.

